{"total_count":550,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/510","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/510/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/510/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/510/events","html_url":"https://github.com/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/510","id":3291454312,"node_id":"I_kwDOK7UGY87EL5to","number":510,"title":"打断能力太弱了，响应最快3秒，最慢更多，没法直接用在对语音有实时性很高追求的项目上","user":{"login":"zhengyiwei1987","id":221923520,"node_id":"U_kgDODTpIwA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/221923520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhengyiwei1987","html_url":"https://github.com/zhengyiwei1987","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhengyiwei1987/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhengyiwei1987/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhengyiwei1987/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhengyiwei1987/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhengyiwei1987/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhengyiwei1987/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhengyiwei1987/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhengyiwei1987/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhengyiwei1987/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":6340352015,"node_id":"LA_kwDOK7UGY88AAAABeeoYDw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"a2eeef","default":true,"description":"New feature or request","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":21,"created_at":"2025-08-05T03:53:45Z","updated_at":"2026-07-02T08:35:35Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"还得继续爆改，\n\n先说说打断，\n在测试场景稍微复杂一点的环境，人多七嘴八舌，就需要极快速度的打断，然后保持静默继续asr持续识别，直到在合适的时候断开，然后再次把之前识别到的内容合并重新发给大模型，这样和大模型的对话才不显得突兀\n\n关于这种语音识别的究极体验，比如豆包也没法做到100%不去胡乱识别，但起码周围在说话的时候能够快速打断，然后静默->持续偷听->持续转换，拾取之前的内容，再次统一发送这个流程做的最好\n\n我不懂python，但观察了代码很久，作者思路挺好，把一切都通过流处理，但是数字人在说话对唇形的时候、你想要极速打断基本很困难，单纯的清空tts和说话的缓冲区，没用，还是有将近3秒延迟，因为webrtc也存在缓冲区，数字人的推理还在进行，想要极速打断只处理其中某个链条好像做不到，有高手知道感谢能提供个思路\n\n\n目前改了语音使用webrtc的语音通道来发送到asr，我目前用的豆包的语音识别大模型，因为不懂python踩了不少坑，采样率和颗粒度很怪异，用ai去改代码改了很久很久才能正常快速识别，可能是app.py中语音通道是50fps的原因，再发送asr前的采样率都很奇怪，需要设置成为8000才行，不然豆包的流式语音识别大模型很不准确\n\n另外我修改了，再数字人说话期间，将语音的能量减弱， 或者完全设置为0，让他数字热人说话的时候减少被干扰，或者完全不被干扰，（我也是webrtc没有在服务端关闭语音通道的方法 只能通过降低音量的方法） \n\n另外数字人说话状态有抖动，尤其是tts慢了一点，说话->静音之间的切换就有抖动，我目前做了个延迟1秒，然后做个演示+阻塞方法，能够准确的通知前端数字人说话的状态，但延迟意味着，精准度再度降低！！！\n\n\n另外，修改了动作编排里的json文件，多个audiotype:1的静音动作组合按顺序执行动作\n\n\n\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/510/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/510/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/423","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/423/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/423/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/423/events","html_url":"https://github.com/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/423","id":2987828885,"node_id":"I_kwDOK7UGY86yFqaV","number":423,"title":"数字人形象实时切换所遇问题与解决","user":{"login":"LiuEhe","id":126216347,"node_id":"U_kgDOB4Xomw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126216347?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiuEhe","html_url":"https://github.com/LiuEhe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiuEhe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiuEhe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiuEhe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiuEhe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiuEhe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiuEhe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiuEhe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiuEhe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiuEhe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":20,"created_at":"2025-04-11T07:36:42Z","updated_at":"2025-10-21T07:41:21Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"目标：在不重启后端的状况下，通过前端选择切换数字人\n   参考 [这个页面](https://github.com/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/341)\n\n LipReal类中添加方法如下：\n`    def change_avatar(self, avatar):\n        self.frame_list_cycle, self.face_list_cycle, self.coord_list_cycle = avatar\n\n        # 当切换数字人形象时，旧形象相关的帧数据不再有用\n        while not self.res_frame_queue.empty():\n            try:\n                self.res_frame_queue.get_nowait()\n            except queue.Empty:\n                break\n\n        logger.info('数字人形象切换完成')`\n\n在前端切换数字人形象，会出现两个问题\n1. 切换后，数字人说话，贴图会是最初始的数字人脸部，这是100多张切换到900多张数字人情况\n2. 切换失败，报错list index out of range，这是900多张切换到100多张数字人情况\n`Exception in thread Thread-3 (process_frames):\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"E:\\tools\\anaconda3\\envs\\nerfstream\\lib\\threading.py\", line 1016, in _bootstrap_inner\n    self.run()\n  File \"E:\\tools\\anaconda3\\envs\\nerfstream\\lib\\threading.py\", line 953, in run\n    self._target(*self._args, **self._kwargs)\n  File \"E:\\LZ\\project\\LiveTalking\\lipreal.py\", line 227, in process_frames\n    combine_frame = self.frame_list_cycle[idx]\nIndexError: list index out of range`\n\n原因在lipreal.py中的render()函数中推理线程仍在用旧的图像进行推理。\n\n解决：\n\n1. 停止当前运行的 inference 线程\n\n2. 更新 avatar 数据\n\n3. 启动新的 inference 线程使用新的 avatar 数据","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/423/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/423/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/120","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/120/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/120/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/120/events","html_url":"https://github.com/lipku/LiveTalking/issues/120","id":2359326042,"node_id":"I_kwDOK7UGY86MoHVa","number":120,"title":"autodl的镜像上运行 没有显示视频","user":{"login":"musexiaoluo","id":31032620,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDMyNjIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31032620?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/musexiaoluo","html_url":"https://github.com/musexiaoluo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/musexiaoluo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/musexiaoluo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/musexiaoluo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/musexiao